{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49013","headline":"晚步 · 姚揆","name":"晚步","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷贫疑本姓颜，晚来闲步出林间。\n数声长笛吹沈日，一片残云点破山。\n岛寺渐疎敲石磬，渔家方半掩柴关。\n迟回从此搜吟久，待得溪头月上还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}